 "form": "<form id=\"contact-form\" novalidate> <div class=\"form-progress\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-valuemin=\"1\" aria-valuemax=\"2\" aria-valuenow=\"1\" aria-label=\"Request progress\"> <span class=\"form-progress-dot is-active\" data-dot=\"1\"></span> <span class=\"form-progress-dot\" data-dot=\"2\"></span> </div> <p class=\"form-step-count\">Step <span id=\"form-step-current\">1</span> of 2</p> <div class=\"form-step is-active\" data-step=\"1\"> <span class=\"form-step-eyebrow\">Who is asking</span> <div class=\"field\"> <label for=\"nombre\">Full name</label> <input type=\"text\" id=\"nombre\" name=\"nombre\" placeholder=\"Your name\" autocomplete=\"name\" required> </div> <div class=\"field\"> <label for=\"empresa\">Company</label> <input type=\"text\" id=\"empresa\" name=\"empresa\" placeholder=\"Your company's name\" autocomplete=\"organization\" required> </div> <div class=\"field\"> <label for=\"email\">Email</label> <input type=\"email\" id=\"email\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@company.com\" autocomplete=\"email\" inputmode=\"email\" required> </div>  <details class=\"form-extra\"><summary>Add a phone number or anything else (optional)</summary> <div class=\"field\"> <label for=\"telefono\">Phone <span class=\"field-optional\">(optional)</span></label> <input type=\"tel\" id=\"telefono\" name=\"telefono\" placeholder=\"+34 600 000 000\" autocomplete=\"tel\" inputmode=\"tel\"> </div> <div class=\"field\"> <label for=\"mensaje\">Which processes would you like to automate? <span class=\"field-optional\">(optional)</span></label> <textarea id=\"mensaje\" name=\"mensaje\" placeholder=\"Give us a quick idea of what you'd like help with...\" autocomplete=\"off\"></textarea> </div> </details> </div> <div class=\"form-step\" data-step=\"2\"> <span class=\"form-step-eyebrow\">Last step</span> <div class=\"form-compliance\"> <div class=\"consent-field\"> <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"acepta-privacidad\" name=\"aceptaPrivacidad\" required> <label for=\"acepta-privacidad\">I have read and accept the <a href=\"/en/privacidad\">Privacy Policy</a>.</label> </div> <div class=\"security-check\"> <span class=\"security-check-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> <span class=\"security-check-copy\"> <span class=\"security-check-label\">Security check</span> <div class=\"cf-turnstile\" data-sitekey=\"0x4AAAAAAD0dueh5OBC9Zdkm\" data-theme=\"auto\" data-size=\"flexible\" data-expired-callback=\"dcodeTurnstileExpired\" data-error-callback=\"dcodeTurnstileError\"></div> </span> </div> </div> <p class=\"form-note\" id=\"form-note\">Once you send it, we read it and write back as soon as we can to understand your case.</p> </div> <div class=\"form-nav\"> <button type=\"button\" class=\"boton form-nav-back\" id=\"form-back-btn\">Back</button> <button type=\"button\" class=\"boton boton--principal form-nav-next\" id=\"form-next-btn\">Continue</button> <button type=\"submit\" class=\"boton boton--principal form-nav-submit\" id=\"form-submit-btn\"> Request the diagnosis </button> </div> </form> <div class=\"form-success\" id=\"form-success\" hidden aria-live=\"polite\"> <div class=\"exito-marca\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div> <p class=\"etiqueta\">Message received</p> <h2 class=\"exito-t\" tabindex=\"-1\">Perfect<span data-exito-nombre></span>. Your message is with us.</h2> <p class=\"exito-lead\">We will read it carefully. Before proposing anything we want to understand your case properly, so we will write to you as soon as we can<span data-exito-email-frase> at <strong data-exito-email></strong></span>.</p> <ol class=\"exito-pasos\"> <li><span class=\"exito-n\">01</span><p><b>We read it</b> A person on the team reads it, not a system answering for us.</p></li> <li><span class=\"exito-n\">02</span><p><b>We write to you</b> With specific questions about how you work today and where your time goes.</p></li> <li><span class=\"exito-n\">03</span><p><b>If it fits, we talk</b> A 30-minute call to tell you what we would build and where we would start.</p></li> </ol> <p class=\"exito-pie\">If you want to add anything, reply to the email you will receive or write to <a href=\"mailto:dcodedepartment@gmail.com\">dcodedepartment@gmail.com</a>. Meanwhile, you can <a href=\"/en/#tocalo\">try the demos</a>.</p> </div>",
